{"3236810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rakshas", "steam_appid": 3236810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> THE PROLOGUE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rakshas: Prologue is a standalone 20–40 minute vertical slice of the full game, built to give you a complete, self-contained horror experience. No filler, no padding every room has a purpose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for answers , you stumble across something that should have remained hidden. Waking up inside a jail cell , with no memory of how you got there. Following an echo from the lower levels, you find your friend trapped and it is upto you to save him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236810/extras/c25299c24c677777975092c646b09b2c.avif?t=1787541810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236810/extras_big/c25299c24c677777975092c646b09b2c.avif?t=1787541810 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORE GAMEPLAY LOOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-first encounters: A monster patrols the upper prison area, guarding what you need to help you escape. Armed with nothing but your wits you must find what you need and get out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration &amp; interaction: Search environmental objects to locate hidden keys and dolls needed to progress between areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzle-solving: The library has a secret upto you to figure out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal horror sequences </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236810/extras/35e8e9fb44760ce71e1450a18142ff9d.avif?t=1787541810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236810/extras_big/35e8e9fb44760ce71e1450a18142ff9d.avif?t=1787541810 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT'S INCLUDED IN THIS PROLOGUE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One fully explorable dungeon level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 collectible voodoo dolls tied to progression-gated keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 stealth-based monster encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 puzzle encounter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 scripted chase sequence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATMOSPHERE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rakshas is built with a photorealistic, dark and gritty visual style , decaying cultist architecture, and an oppressive, eerie sound design designed to keep tension high throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236810/extras/f13dda94c7ca2b5a0555c62773c65b60.avif?t=1787541810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236810/extras_big/f13dda94c7ca2b5a0555c62773c65b60.avif?t=1787541810 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> THE PROLOGUE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rakshas: Prologue is a standalone 20–40 minute vertical slice of the full game, built to give you a complete, self-contained horror experience. No filler, no padding every room has a purpose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for answers , you stumble across something that should have remained hidden. Waking up inside a jail cell , with no memory of how you got there. Following an echo from the lower levels, you find your friend trapped and it i